{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.QuantumFlatness","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.QuantumFlatness","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Logic.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.IsQuantumFlat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.IsQuantumFlat","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/quantum-flatness.lean#L24-L29","doc":"**Quantum flatness**: a 2-connection `(A, B)` is *quantum flat* when the\ncurvature `F_∇` of the ordinary connection equals the 2-form datum `B`,\ni.e. `F_∇ = B`.  Stated as a predicate on the curvature and the 2-form\ndatum, valued in an arbitrary type `V` of `Ad`-valued 2-forms. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:quantum-flatness","label":"def:quantum-flatness","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/quantum-flatness.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}